<title>UK: Sutton Bridge unit prices 195 mln stg 25-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Sutton Bridge unit prices 195 mln stg 25-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced announced earlier by joint lead managers BZW and Merrill Lynch has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUTTON BRIDGE FINANCING LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SUTTON BRIDGE POWER</p>
<p> AMT	195 MLN STG COUPON     8.625     MATURITY    30.JUN.22</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.523    PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    99.523    SPREAD	+135 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA3	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 9.0 PCT 2011 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR DEBT SECURED BY A CHARGE OVER ASSETS OF THE</p>
<p>		ISSUER AND GUARANTOR.</p>
<p>		THERE IS A SIMULTANEOUS LAUNCH OF $150 MLN SECURED</p>
<p>		144A BOND</p>
<p>		SINKING FUND TO GIVE AVG LIFE 14 YEARS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
